flowchart TD
    A[Goal / user task] --> B[Plan: decompose into steps]
    B --> C[Observe state + memory]
    C --> D[Decide next action]
    D --> E{Need a tool?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Call tool / API / retrieval]
    F --> G[Observe result]
    G --> C
    E -- No --> H{Goal met or stop condition?}
    H -- No --> C
    H -- Yes --> I[Final answer]
    C -.guardrails.-> J[Budget, max steps, safety checks]
    C -.persist.-> K[Memory: short and long term]
